'''Basajaun''' ({{Literal translation|lord of the woods}}), is the historic capital of [[Arcadia]], within the [[Cerdanya|Cerdanyan community]]. In the [[2020 Baliscan census|2020 census]], the communal population was 97,891 people, making it the x-most populous in [[Baliscan Confederation|Balisca]]. Situated on the western edge of the [[Strait of Ivorra]], Basajaun is a popular tourist destination, owing to its beaches, [[W:Surf culture|surf culture]], and historic, predominately [[W:Basque culture|Basque]], local culture.
